keiko 1
# A1 (a held model answer) — the held answer keeps the decision pending across
# waits, the overlay turns it held, and the release lands it once the overlay
# closes again.
# Excluded: the answer text (the take stays offline; no live call), Auto/skip
# interaction with the hold (their own cases).
fault decision-hold ace.greet
setting play.text_speed 0

new-game
advance
advance
pick "Ask about the letter"
advance
advance
expect decision pending
wait 500ms
expect decision pending
menu
expect decision held
release-decision ace.greet
menu
expect decision none
expect line contains "Oh. It's you."
